Date: Tue, 12 May 2026 15:44:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] nvidia-modprobe: move to linuxPackages.nvidiaPackages

nvidia-modprobe matches the driver it belongs to, so it moves into that driver's
namespace next to the other tools, as nvidiaPackages.<branch>.modprobe. The
NixOS module takes it from cfg.package.modprobe for its udev rules, so every
branch has to carry it.

pkgs.nvidia-modprobe becomes a warning alias for
linuxPackages.nvidiaPackages.latest.modprobe.

