+- `linuxPackages.nvidiaPackages.<branch>` is now an attribute set: `.driver`
+  holds the driver, with `.settings`, `.modprobe`, `.persistenced` and
+  `.fabricmanager`, where `.settings` and `.persistenced` can be `null`, and the
+  kernel modules stay at `.mod` and `.open`. The new top-level
+  `pkgs.nvidiaPackages` has the same drivers without a kernel.
+
+  ```diff
+  -buildInputs = [ linuxPackages.nvidia_x11.settings.libXNVCtrl ];
+  +buildInputs = [ pkgs.nvidiaPackages.stable.settings.libXNVCtrl ];
+  ```
+
+  The old output names `.out`, `.bin`, `.lib32` and `.firmware` warn and return
+  the driver's output or passthru entry where the branch has one; a name it
+  lacks fails like any missing attribute.
+  `.modsrc` throws; the kernel module is built from the installer's unpacked
+  tree.
+
 - `moon` has been updated to `2.x` and needs manual migration. See the [migration guide](https://moonrepo.dev/docs/migrate/2.0) for instructions.
 
